    "homeType": "CONDO",
    "description": "1324 Lake Street offers a rare opportunity to own on one of San Francisco's most desirable neighborhoods. This well maintained 2-bedroom, 2-bath home with parking combines original charm with a solid contemporary framework. Hardwood floors, detailed trim, and a classic fireplace bring warmth. The kitchen and baths share just the right amount of vintage appeal; yet modern electrical wiring ensures both function and peace of mind. Set on a tree-lined street known for its affluence and curb appeal, Lake Street living delivers unmatched convenience. From Mountain Lake's tennis courts and dog park, to the weekly farmers' market and dining options along Clement Street, the neighborhood is brimming with character and energy. Within blocks, you'll find multiple entrances into the Presidio's trails and green spaces, as well as easy access to Baker Beach. Commuters will appreciate the quick connection to the Golden Gate Bridge and 19th Avenue, while cyclists and walkers will relish the daily ease of having the City's best park, shops, and cafes close by."
  },
